# Tala the trader, a placed NPC of the test level (US-270). Her own script: nobody else is given it, because no clan member is called npc-tala.
@who npc-tala

=== start
Tala: Good wares for good people, {hero}.
-> Ask about the road => road
-> Praise her wares {opinion npc hero 5; remember npc "{hero} praised my wares" 20} => thanks
-> Leave => END

=== road
Tala: The road north is quiet. The goblin by the stones is not.
-> Back => start

=== thanks
Tala: Kind of you. I will remember it.
-> Back => start
